# Build-time config for production builds (Vercel runs `vite build`).
#
# This file is committed on purpose. The VAPID *public* key is not a secret:
# it is the application-server identifier, it is shipped inside every client
# bundle, and it is handed to push services by the browser. Only
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY is secret, and that lives in Supabase function secrets --
# never here, and never with a VITE_ prefix.
#
# Vercel dashboard environment variables override this file, so moving the
# value there later is safe. If the key pair is ever rotated, update both.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=BMnPiXxaAagXv0HD_6k1ySg66Fsg9MDUArmduSoirdv74-R_C2llQnB2RAq5KeMB0DcQFodRJcUZgXNn3_UqZIw
